.TH WP\-ALIASES 1 "June 2026" "WP-CLI-aliases" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
wp\-aliases \- shell shortcuts for WP\-CLI commands
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wp\-aliases
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
.B install.sh
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.PP
.B setup.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B WP\-CLI\-aliases
is a collection of short bash/zsh shell aliases that reduce the typing
required for common WP\-CLI commands.  For example, instead of typing
\fBwp plugin install\fR you can type \fBwppi\fR.
.PP
The project provides three entry points:
.TP
.B install.sh
The master installer.  Sources alias files into your shell configuration
(\fI~/.bashrc\fR, \fI~/.zshrc\fR, or \fI~/.profile\fR).
.TP
.B setup.sh
An interactive wizard that lets you pick which alias categories to install.
.TP
.B wp\-aliases
A post\-install management tool for listing, searching, and exploring aliases.
.SH INSTALL OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-all
Install every alias category.
.TP
.B \-\-popular
Install only the curated popular\-commands set (recommended for new users).
.TP
\fB\-\-category\fR \fINAME\fR
Install a specific category.  May be repeated.
.TP
.B \-\-interactive
Launch the interactive setup wizard (\fBsetup.sh\fR).
.TP
.B \-\-list
Print all available category names.
.TP
.B \-\-uninstall
Remove all WP\-CLI alias entries from your shell configuration file.
.TP
\fB\-\-shell\-config\fR \fIFILE\fR
Override the target shell configuration file.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show install help text and exit.
.SH WP\-ALIASES COMMANDS
.TP
.B list
Print every alias across all categories.
.TP
\fBlist \-\-category\fR \fICAT\fR
Print aliases for the named category (e.g.\& \fIplugin\fR, \fIdb\fR, \fIpopular\fR).
.TP
.B categories
Print all categories with short descriptions.
.TP
\fBsearch\fR \fITERM\fR
Search alias names and descriptions for \fITERM\fR.
.TP
.B man
Display this man page.
.TP
.BR help ", " \-\-help ", " \-h
Show usage information.
.SH ALIAS CATEGORIES
.TP
.B core
WordPress core: download, install, update, verify\-checksums, version.
.TP
.B plugin
Plugins: install, activate, deactivate, list, update, delete, status.
.TP
.B theme
Themes: install, activate, list, update, delete, status.
.TP
.B post
Posts: create, get, list, update, delete, meta.
.TP
.B user
Users: create, get, list, update, delete, roles, meta.
.TP
.B option
Options: get, add, update, delete, list, autoload filters.
.TP
.B db
Database: create, drop, import, export, query, CLI, optimize, repair, check, clean, size, search.
.TP
.B config
wp\-config.php: create, get, set, delete, list, path, shuffle\-salts.
.TP
.B search\-replace
Search and replace strings across the database; dry\-run, regex, export modes.
.TP
.B cache
Object cache: flush, get, set, add, delete.  Also covers transients.
.TP
.B cron
WP\-Cron: list events, run events, create/delete events, list schedules, test.
.TP
.B term
Taxonomy terms: create, get, list, update, delete, meta, generate.
.TP
.B comment
Comments: create, get, list, update, delete, approve, spam, trash.
.TP
.B media
Media: import, regenerate thumbnails, list image sizes.
.TP
.B rewrite
Rewrite rules: flush (soft and hard), list, set structure.
.TP
.B role
User roles & capabilities: create/list/delete roles; add/list/remove capabilities.
.TP
.B scaffold
Code generation: plugin, theme, child\-theme, post\-type, taxonomy, block scaffolding.
.TP
.B package
WP\-CLI packages: install, list, update, remove, browse, path.
.TP
.B import\-export
Content: import WXR files, export all or filtered content.
.TP
.B eval
PHP evaluation: eval inline code, eval\-file, common one\-liners.
.TP
.B popular
Curated set of the most frequently used aliases from all categories.
