.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Install the popular alias set:
.RS
.EX
./install.sh --popular
source ~/.bashrc
.EE
.RE
.PP
Then use plugin shortcuts:
.RS
.EX
wppi query-monitor           # wp plugin install query-monitor
wppia debug-bar              # wp plugin install debug-bar --activate
wppua                        # wp plugin update --all
wppl                         # wp plugin list
.EE
.RE
.PP
Database workflows:
.RS
.EX
wpdbe backup.sql             # wp db export backup.sql
wpdbi staging.sql            # wp db import staging.sql
wpsr 'http://old.dev' 'https://new.dev'   # wp search-replace
wpsrd 'http://old.dev' 'https://new.dev'  # preview first
.EE
.RE
.PP
Theme management:
.RS
.EX
wptia twentytwentyfive       # install + activate theme
wptua                        # update all themes
wptl                         # list themes
.EE
.RE
.PP
Explore and search aliases post\-install:
.RS
.EX
wp-aliases categories
wp-aliases list --category db
wp-aliases search cache
.EE
.RE
